<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="index.php">Products</a> / Add product</div><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">UC-P01 / EMPLOYEE DEMONSTRATION</span><h1>Add product</h1><p>Create a clear record for a new ski product. All fields are required.</p></div></div><div id="page-error" class="notice error" role="alert" hidden></div><div class="form-layout" id="editor-layout"><form id="product-form" class="panel" data-mode="create" novalidate><div id="form-errors" class="notice error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div><fieldset><legend>Product specifications</legend><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="name">Product name <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="name" name="name" required maxlength="80" aria-describedby="name-error"><span class="field-error" id="name-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="skiType">Ski type <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="skiType" name="skiType" required aria-describedby="skiType-error"><option value="">Select a type</option><option>Park</option><option>Powder</option><option>Touring</option></select><span class="field-error" id="skiType-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="size">Size in cm <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="size" name="size" type="number" min="1" step="1" required aria-describedby="size-error"><span class="field-error" id="size-error"></span></div><div class="field full"><label for="makeup">Construction <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="makeup" name="makeup" required aria-describedby="makeup-error"><option value="">Select construction</option><option>Full carbon</option><option>Hybrid</option></select><span class="field-error" id="makeup-error"></span></div></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Pricing and inventory</legend><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="price">Selling price in USD <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="price" name="price" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required aria-describedby="price-error"><span class="field-error" id="price-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="cost">Manufacturing cost in USD <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="cost" name="cost" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required aria-describedby="cost-error"><span class="field-error" id="cost-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="quantity">Finished stock in pairs <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="quantity" name="quantity" type="number" min="0" step="1" required aria-describedby="quantity-help quantity-error"><small id="quantity-help">Use a whole number. One pair contains two skis.</small><span class="field-error" id="quantity-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="employee">Responsible employee <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="employee" name="employee" required aria-describedby="employee-error"><option value="">Select an employee</option><option value="E01">E01 · Alex Morgan</option><option value="E02">E02 · Sam Rivera</option></select><span class="field-error" id="employee-error"></span></div><div class="field full"><label for="productStatus">Product status <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="productStatus" name="status" required aria-describedby="status-error"><option>Active</option><option>Inactive</option></select><span class="field-error" id="status-error"></span></div></div></fieldset><div class="form-footer"><button class="primary" type="submit">Add product</button><a class="btn" id="cancel-form" href="index.php">Cancel</a><small>Temporary demo changes only</small></div></form><aside class="panel aside"><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU SAVE</span><h2>A record the whole workshop can use</h2><ul><li>Product IDs are assigned automatically and cannot be edited.</li><li>Prices and costs must be zero or greater.</li><li>Finished inventory uses whole pairs.</li><li>Manufacturing cost is internal information.</li><li>Current price changes must not change historical order-line prices in the final system.</li></ul><p class="notice">This prototype updates sample data in this tab. It does not write to a database.</p><p><small>Prototype conventions: positive whole centimeters; USD amounts up to two decimals. These choices need team review.</small></p></aside></div></main>
